WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.350
A question says: outline three Christian
beliefs about life after death.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.220
It is worth 3 marks.

3
00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.130
The next question says: explain two.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.700
It is worth 4.

5
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.820
So the second asks for fewer
points, yet gives more marks.

6
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.340
Why does outline want three short points,

7
00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.240
but explain want two longer ones?

8
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.390
In this mission, you'll meet
a question in four parts,

9
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.910
a to d, adding up to 24 marks.

10
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.920
Then you'll plan answers about marriage
and see which plans earn every mark.

11
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:39.080
Your mission: find out why outline three
and explain two need such different answers.
